# Title: Sysmon Application Crashed
# ID: 4d7f1827-1637-4def-8d8a-fd254f9454df
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Tim Shelton
# Date: 2022-04-26
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects application popup reporting a failure of the Sysmon service
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(Provider_Name equals "Application Popup" AND EventID equals "26" AND (Caption equals "sysmon64.exe - Application Error" OR Caption equals "sysmon.exe - Application Error"))
